  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK-Brazil Cluster Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Cluster Initiative aims to support the development and decarbonization of key ports/industrial clusters in Brazil by facilitating structured knowledge-sharing, technical cooperation, and strategic planning. The Cluster Initiative aims to delivers support activities to the Port of A&#xe7;u, the Port of Suape, and potentially the Port of Pec&#xe9;m (pending further discussions and feasibility within the project#s timeframe), while also developing long-term recommendations for the Ports to take forward beyond 2026.</narrative>
  </description>
